{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45181","headline":"早春送颜主簿游越东兼谒元中丞 · 皎然","name":"早春送颜主簿游越东兼谒元中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻舸趣不已，东风吹绿苹。\n欲看梅市雪，知赏柳家春。\n别意倾吴醑，芳声动越人。\n山阴三月会，内史得嘉宾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}